### GET Training Sessions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/training-sessions/users/1

### Create Training Session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/training-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "trainingDate": "2026-08-03",
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "feeling": 5,
  "note": "スマッシュとフットワーク練習"
}

### Get Training Records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/training-sessions/5/records

### Create Training Record
POST http://localhost:8080/api/training-sessions/5/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "sets": 5,
  "repetitions": 5,
  "weightKg": 100.0,
  "note": "フォーム確認"
}

### Get Training Record
GET http://localhost:8080/api/training-records/3

### Update Training Record
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/training-records/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "sets": 5,
  "repetitions": 5,
  "weightKg": 105.0,
  "note": "重量を更新"
}

### Delete Training Record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/training-records/3
